# Poseidon2 BN254 constants, t = 20: NOT externally referenced

No external reference for BN254 Poseidon2 parameters with t = 20 was found, so these tables
come from this repository's own generator: `generator-rs/src/round_constants.rs`
(`generate_params_uncached(20)`, a port of the HorizenLabs `poseidon2_rust_params.sage`
script) at commit 93ee03367af2, dumped and transcribed by a script.
The same generator reproduces the externally referenced tables for t = 2, 3, 4, 8, 12, 16
value for value (checked when this file was written). `ROUNDS_F = 8`, `ROUNDS_P = 57`.

The round constants are also derived independently: `GrainCheck.lean` proves they are the
output of the Grain LFSR generation of the HorizenLabs script (`Grain.lean`) for this t, R_F
and R_P. `DiagCheck.lean` proves the internal diagonal `diagM1` is the script's diagonal draw
number 42 after them; that this draw is the first one passing the script's minimal-polynomial
check, and the round numbers, have no independent check here. A claim about t = 20 is a claim about the
permutation with these constants.
-/

